{"availability":"available","full":"r3al1tym/termscene","name":"termscene","description":"Show the terminal experience before you build it — render a mock terminal you script into clean, deterministic mp4/gif/webm. Built for a coding assistant to drive.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-12T10:34:56Z","updated":"2026-09-11T19:44:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://r3al1tym.github.io/termscene/","topics":["cli","demo","deterministic","gif","mp4","screencast","terminal","webcodecs"],"demo":"https://r3al1tym.github.io/termscene/playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.243Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.243Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.243Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.243Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Show the terminal experience before you build it.","▶ Try it in the browser playground — author, preview & export a clip with no install · Gallery","termscene renders a mock terminal you fully control. You script the typed commands and their output in a small declarative file, and it renders to mp4, GIF, or WebM. The session doesn't have to be real — so you can show an experience that only exists as an idea: a concept you're pitching, a flow that doesn't exist yet, a clip for a deck or a post."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/r3al1tym/termscene/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9023924d8d32ac112d3bab2439d869fe81cd7f73e39b9cb608ef728578e3dff9","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.491Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:28.491Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Show the terminal experience before you build it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/r3al1tym/termscene/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9023924d8d32ac112d3bab2439d869fe81cd7f73e39b9cb608ef728578e3dff9","sourceUrl":"https://githu